  "ai.orion81Builds": "Orion-81 yazimbibwa ku pulogulaamu ey'ensibuko eggule ewandiikiddwa abantu. Eri wano kubanga si ya AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 pulojekiti eyakolebwa AI yonna.<\/0> Buli layini y'enkoodi ya Orion-81 yennyini yawandiikibwa na Claude Code, ng'omutandisi y'alagira. Buli kyombo, maapu, endabika n'eddoboozi byakolebwa ebikozesebwa Claude Code bye yawandiika. Omutandisi asalawo ekyokukola; Claude Code alaba engeri y'okukikolamu. Amaterekero ag'ensibuko eggule gye yazimbibwako gali wansi wa 'Si bya AI'. Ekintu kimu kikyali tekinaggwa era kiragibwa mu lwatu: <1>okwekebejja layisinsi<\/1> y'enkoodi y'omuzannyo eyava mu kyokulabirako kya GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Orion yatandika nga 28 Ssebutemba 2026 ng'ekyokulabirako ku kyuma ky'omuzannyo kya Quake III Arena eky'ensibuko eggule (GPL), ng'ebyombo bya Elite Dangerous bye byamuleetera okukisinziirako. Ku lunaku olw'okubiri enkoodi y'omuzannyo yaggyibwa ku BuB, ekyuma ky'omuzannyo ekipya ekyawandiikibwa na Claude Code; ebitundu by'omuzannyo byava mu kyokulabirako ne bikyusibwa amannya. Enkyusa 0.3.0 yawa ebika byonna 16 eby'ebyombo emibiri gyabyo emipya. Okwekebejja okukwatagana kw'amateeka ga layisinsi kukebera oba enkoodi yonna ekyava ku GPL eyasooka, n'oba ebifaananyi by'ebyombo eby'olubereberye bisembedde nnyo ku bye byasinziirwako. Okukebera okw'ekyuma okw'okufaanana kw'enkoodi n'ensibuko y'ekyokulabirako kya GPL kwakolebwa nga 8 Okitobba 2026, era okwekebejja kw'abakugu ku bye kwazuula kugenda mu maaso. Buli ekivudde ku yo kijja kuwandiikibwa buggya oba kuddamu kukolebwa.",
