  "economy.todayHead": "Ebiriwo leero",
  "economy.todayLead": "Amadaala g'omubiri n'engabo ne langi z'engabo eza LOADOUT (0.6.0) biraga ekika ky'okulongoosa n'okusiiga ebyenfuna bye bigenderera okuwa.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Kubanga ssente zaagwo zigendereddwamu okubasasula. Omuzannyo gutandika nga gwa AI ddala asobole okubaawo, olwo abakubi b'ebifaananyi abasasulwa ne bazzaawo omulimu gwa AI, nga bayitibwa mu mannya.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Nsobola okuzannya ku mukutu?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Kuzannyibwa ku bwereere?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Ebibuuzo",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Nedda nga tennaba. Okuzannya kwa LAN ku mukutu gumu kukola leero (okuva mu 0.2.0); okuzannya ku mukutu tekunnakolebwa.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Ekyokulabirako kyazimbibwa ku kyuma ky'omuzannyo kya Quake III Arena eky'ensibuko eggule (GPL) era ebyombo bya Elite Dangerous bye byakisinziirwako. Ku lunaku olw'okubiri enkoodi y'omuzannyo yaggyibwa ku BuB, ekyuma ekipya ekyawandiikibwa na Claude Code; ebitundu by'omuzannyo byava mu kyokulabirako ne bikyusibwa amannya. Enkyusa 0.3.0 yawa ebika byonna 16 eby'ebyombo emibiri emipya. Okwekebejja okukwatagana kw'amateeka ga layisinsi kukebera oba enkoodi yonna ekyava ku GPL eyasooka era oba ebifaananyi by'ebyombo eby'olubereberye bisembedde nnyo ku bye byasinziirwako. Okukebera okw'ekyuma okw'okufaanana kw'enkoodi n'ensibuko y'ekyokulabirako kya GPL kwakolebwa nga <0/>, era okwekebejja kw'abakugu ku bye kwazuula kugenda mu maaso. Buli ekivudde ku yo kijja kuwandiikibwa buggya oba kuddamu kukolebwa. Okutuusa okwekebejja lwe kuggwa, tetugamba nti eky'okuddamu kiri nedda.",
  "faq.questions": "Ebibuuzo",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Ebyombo, ebifaananyi, enkola y'okukozesa n'ebirala, ssente nga ziriwo. <0>Ekitabo ky'okuzzaawo ku lupapula luno<\/0> kiraga buli kintu era kijja kulaga buli kuzzaawo n'omukubi w'ebifaananyi.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Ebyombo n'okulongoosa biteekebwateekebwa okufunibwa mu kuzannya oba okugulibwa. Engeri ebyombo ebisasulwa gye bisigala nga bya bwenkanya mu kulwanagana kw'omuzannyi n'omuzannyi ekyali kitegekebwa.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Eyo y'enteekateeka: okuzannya ku bwereere nga kulimu ssente z'omu muzannyo n'okusiiga eby'okulonda. Tekinnakolebwa.",
