  "faq.willPayWin": "Gujja kuba gwa sasula owangule?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Tewali lunaku lwa kuggyibwa wadde bbeeyi okutuusa kati.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude ne Claude Code bubonero bw'obusuubuzi bwa Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine ne Epic Games bubonero bw'obusuubuzi bwa Epic Games, Inc. Blender kabonero k'obusuubuzi aka Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena ne Elite Dangerous bubonero bw'obusuubuzi bwa bannannyini bwabyo. Amannya gonna gali ga bannannyini gaago era gakozesebwa kuzuula bintu ebyogerwako byokka. Orion-81 tekwatagana nabo, tewagirwa wadde okukkirizibwa bonna ku bo.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Kye twagala, so si ndagaano. Tewali nkolagana, kwegatta wadde kuwagirwa.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Omukutu gujja",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Ebikwata ku nkulaakulana ku YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Goberera Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Bakwano abagenda okubaawo?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Tewali bigoberera bakozesa. Tewali cookies. Omukutu gw'okulaga. Buli kituufu kisobola okugoberebwa okutuuka ku bukuumi bwa pulojekiti; tewali kintu wano kiweebwa oba kisuubizibwa.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Tekinnatandika",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Ekintu kimu kikyali tekinaggwa: <0>okwekebejja layisinsi<\/0> y'enkoodi y'omuzannyo eyava mu kyokulabirako kya GPL. Okukebera okw'ekyuma okw'okufaanana kw'enkoodi n'ensibuko y'ekyokulabirako kwakolebwa nga <1/>, era okwekebejja kw'abakugu ku bye kwazuula kugenda mu maaso.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 pulojekiti eyakolebwa AI yonna.<\/0> Enkoodi ya Orion-81 yennyini eyakolebwa Claude Code, ng'omutandisi y'alagira; ebyombo, amaapu, endabika n'amaloboozi byakolebwa ebikozesebwa Claude Code bye yawandiika. Amaterekero ag'ensibuko eggule ge ekozesa gali wansi wa <1>'Si bya AI'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Wansi w'omukutu",
  "hero.behindThisPlate": "Emabega w'ekipande kino: ekyokulabirako kya ORION-1 eky'omu muzannyo okuva mu nkyusa 0.6.1, kikubibwa mu kaseera ako mu kyuma kyo ekiraba omukutu (kikyusiddwa okukozesebwa ku mukutu, endabika ewummuziddwa okutuuka ku 512 px).",
  "hero.behindThisPlate2": "Emabega w'ekipande kino: ekifaananyi ekyakwatibwa mu muzannyo okuva mu nkyusa 0.6.1. 3D ey'okukwatako ezikiziddwa ku kyuma kino.",
