  "why.anthropic": "Eri Anthropic",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic": "<0>Economic Index ya Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> ezuula nti abakozi abaakatandika emirimu balaba nti ebisinga ku mulimu gwabwe AI esobola okubikola.",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic2": "<0>Enkola y'enteekateeka y'ebyenfuna eya Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> esaba ebitongole okuyigiriza era okuteeka abantu mu mirimu emirala mu kifo ky'okubagoba.",
  "why.anthropicSReview": "<0>Okwekebejja kwa Anthropic ku bujulizi bw'okuyigiriza (<1/>)<\/0> kuzuula nti enteekateeka ezikwatagana n'abakozesa era ez'ekitundu ekimu zikola bulungi.",
  "why.askSimpleFive": "Kye twagala kyangu: ebifo bya Claude ttaano okutandika. Omutandisi bw'asobola okubijjuza n'abantu abalina ebitone era abagoyebwa, tujja kulaga engeri AI gy'esobola okukozesebwamu n'ekigendererwa ekirungi okukola ekintu ekirabika obulungi.",
